cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Dimvexa in research or in a published report, please cite it as below."
title: "Dimvexa: exact, fast unit conversion for Rust"
abstract: >-
  Dimvexa is a Rust library for unit conversion in science and engineering.
  Every conversion factor is an exact rational with a cited source and a recorded
  exactness (defined or measured). Temperature differences, temperature points and
  ambiguous symbols are kept apart, and unsupported or ambiguous requests fail with a
  stable error code instead of a guess. Exact factors. Loud failures. Zero guessing.
type: software
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/welworx/dimvexa"
url: "https://github.com/welworx/dimvexa"
authors:
  - family-names: "Liemberger"
    given-names: "Werner"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3226-5890"
keywords:
  - units
  - unit conversion
  - dimensional analysis
  - rust
